%% frame: UC3 B9 to B11: fulfilment of a START, order side (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Svc as :StripeCheckoutService
    participant OFA as :OrderFulfilmentAdapter
    participant Set as :GroupDealSettlementSupport
    participant Intents as :PurchaseIntentRepository
    participant Users as :UserAppService
    participant Cat as :CatalogPurchaseSupport
    participant Groups as :PaidGroupDealService
    create participant Ord as :Order
    participant Orders as :OrderRepository

    Note over Svc,Groups: B8: inside the settlement transaction of @sec-a-pay-upfront
    Svc->>OFA: lockForSettlement(quote)
    OFA->>Set: lockTeam(dealId): lock 1, no row
    OFA->>Intents: lockById(intentId): lock 2
    OFA-->>Svc: void
    Note over Svc,Groups: lock 3 is the payment; a quote past its deadline is refused there (A5)
    Svc->>OFA: fulfil(event)
    OFA->>Set: lockTeam(dealId): no row
    OFA->>Intents: lockById(intentId): already held
    break intent already fulfilled: replay, or INTENT_ALREADY_FULFILLED (A7)
        OFA-->>Svc: Outcome
    end
    Note over OFA,Cat: B9
    OFA->>Users: requireActive(userId)
    OFA->>Cat: requirePurchasable(productId)
    break INTENT_EXPIRED, BUYER_INACTIVE or PRODUCT_UNAVAILABLE (A5)
        OFA-->>Svc: Outcome(rejection)
    end
    Note over OFA,Groups: B10: @fig-a-uc03-ds-create
    OFA->>OFA: admit(event, intent)
    OFA->>Groups: startConfirmed(terms, paid)
    Groups-->>OFA: ParticipationResult
    alt applied (B11)
        OFA->>Ord: «create» create(terms, confirmedAt)
        OFA->>Orders: save(order): PENDING
        OFA->>Set: linkOrder(dealId, paymentId, orderId)
        OFA->>Intents: markFulfilled(intent, paymentId)
        OFA->>Cat: consumeOneUnit(productId)
        break last unit taken by a concurrent settlement: everything rolls back (E1)
            Cat-->>OFA: false
            OFA-->>Svc: IllegalStateException
        end
        OFA-->>Svc: Outcome(dealId, orderId, null)
    else compensation required (A6)
        OFA-->>Svc: Outcome(dealId, null, "GROUP_REJECTED")
    end
